PARITY MAPPING  (web -> Apple platform primitives/tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex)
  MapContainer + MapTileLayer  -> Map(position:) + .mapStyle(TSMapStyle.mapStyle) ; web 'dark' default -> .standard
  Polyline (speed colour)      -> MapPolyline(per pair).stroke(TripReplayPalette.color(for: band), 4)
  speedColor #10b981/#22d3ee/  -> TripReplaySpeedBand slow/moderate/fast/veryFast -> statusSuccess / accent /
    #f59e0b/#ef4444               statusWarning / statusDanger (theme-tracking semantic tokens, not raw hex)
  CircleMarker start/end/anchor-> Annotation { TSCircleMarker(tone: .success / .danger / .accent) }
  AnimatedMarker(heading)      -> TripReplayPlayheadMarker — a heading-rotated SF arrow ("location.north.fill")
                                  + a reduce-motion-aware pulse (Reduce Motion suppresses the pulse + snaps the
                                  arrow = the web reduced-motion CircleMarker fallback)
  FitBounds / useMap           -> MapCameraPosition + TSMapCamera.fitting (TSGeo.boundingRegion) ; refit on route change
  handlePolylineClick -> seek  -> MapReader + MapProxy.convert(point,.local) -> TripReplayGeo.nearestSampleIndex
                                  -> model.seek(to:) -> source (web onSeekToIndex; page stays the source of truth)
  MapLayerSwitcher             -> TripReplayLayerSwitcher (segmented Picker over TSMapStyle, labels via the
                                  surface P1/S10 table — the same surface-scoped pattern 0147 RouteMapSection uses)
  GlassPanel                   -> .tsGlassPanel material + rounded clip + border ; the loaded map applies the same
                                  material directly so it bleeds to the panel edge (web overflow-hidden rounded-xl)
  EmptyState / AlertBanner     -> TripReplayEmptyView (ContentUnavailableView) / TripReplayStationaryBanner
  haversine/isValid/route/...  -> TripReplayGeo (Double maths, en-golden values asserted against the web expressions)
  i18n                         -> every string via TripReplayMapStrings (NSLocalizedString table "TripReplayMap",
                                  web literal as the value: fallback)
  a11y                         -> canvas labelled (route / stationary / empty summary) ; start/end/anchor/playhead
