STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  -> redacted skeleton map (parent isLoading with no samples yet).
  empty    -> "No position data available for this drive" + a pin-slash icon (web positions.length===0), never blank.
  error    -> retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web parent owns fetching).
  data     -> the speed-coloured route + start/end pins + heading playhead + layer switcher; OR (stationary GPS)
              the single anchor marker + the "Route can't be plotted" banner — both reproduced.
  stale    -> freshness chip + one-shot auto-refresh on the live->stale transition (cached route stays visible).
  offline  -> freshness chip over the last-loaded route; no auto-refresh.

